+# Meeting Records Implementation Plan
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development. Assigned implementer runs TDD; parent reviews and integrates.
+
+**Goal:** Durable validated local meeting records, source-linked extractive notes/actions and export.
+**Architecture:** Immutable validated snapshots in dedicated SQLite rows, using LocalSqliteStore.Open unchanged. Atomic parameterized upsert and literal bounded search.
+**Tech Stack:** .NET 8, Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 8.0.31, xUnit.
+
+## Constraints
+Owned Meetings source/tests and this plan/report only. No cloud/model, hardware, UI, secrets or user data. No implicit memory promotion. Exports return strings, caller selects destination. Deletion is logical database deletion, not secure erasure or deletion of external exports.
+
+## Exact public API (OpenClicky.Core.Meetings)
+- enum MeetingState { Draft, Recording, Completed }
+- sealed record MeetingConsent(DateTimeOffset GrantedAt, string Sources)
+- sealed record TranscriptSegment(string Id, TimeSpan Start, TimeSpan End, string Text)
+- sealed record MeetingNote(string Id, string SessionId, string SegmentId, string Text, bool IsAction)
+- sealed class MeetingSession(string id, string title, DateTimeOffset createdAt, DateTimeOffset? expiresAt = null, MeetingState state = Draft, MeetingConsent? consent = null, IEnumerable<TranscriptSegment>? segments = null, IEnumerable<MeetingNote>? notes = null): read-only Id, Title, CreatedAt, ExpiresAt, State, Consent, IReadOnlyList<TranscriptSegment> Segments, IReadOnlyList<MeetingNote> Notes; MeetingSession StartRecording(MeetingConsent consent); MeetingSession ExtractNotes(); MeetingSession DeleteSource(string segmentId).
+- sealed class MeetingStore(string databasePath): void Save(MeetingSession session); MeetingSession? Get(string id); IReadOnlyList<MeetingSession> Search(string query, int limit = 50); bool Delete(string id); int PurgeExpired(DateTimeOffset now).
+- static class MeetingExport: string Json(MeetingSession session, DateTimeOffset exportedAt); string Markdown(MeetingSession session, DateTimeOffset exportedAt).
+
+Validation: IDs ASCII alphanumeric/-/_, 1..100; title 1..500; sources 1..2000; text 1..16000; <=10000 segments/notes; nonnegative ranges, end > start, <=7 days; unique IDs; same-session existing-source references with verbatim text. Expiry > creation. Recording requires consent >= creation. Actions only verbatim segments beginning ACTION:; no inferred owners, dates, speakers or decisions.
+
+### Task: validated records and persistence
+Create apps/windows/OpenClicky.Core/Meetings/MeetingSession.cs, MeetingStore.cs, MeetingExport.cs and tests/OpenClicky.Core.Tests/Meetings/MeetingRecordsTests.cs.
+- [x] Add tests using `Assert.Throws<ArgumentException>(() => new MeetingSession("s", "t", at, state: MeetingState.Recording))`, duplicate/invalid segments, reference integrity, input bounds, immutable copies, deterministic extraction, durable reopen/search, transactional failure, retention and escaping.
+- [x] Run `dotnet test tests/OpenClicky.Core.Tests -c Release --filter FullyQualifiedName~Meetings`; preserve full logs/exits in ignored .codex-build/meeting-evidence. Bootstrap missing types are not behavioral red; add throwing API skeleton and rerun before implementation.
+- [x] Implement constructor validation/defensive copies, deterministic notes, cascade source removal, transactional SQLite storage and timestamped JSON/Markdown with escaped text and explicit source anchors.
+- [x] Run focused then full `dotnet test tests/OpenClicky.Core.Tests -c Release`, retain logs/exits, inspect diff and owned paths.
+- [x] Commit owned files only and provide API/evidence/limitations report for parent review.
